WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,077 --> 00:00:03,292
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,342 --> 00:00:05,547
This is Episode 55.

3
00:00:05,597 --> 00:00:06,756
Morning.

4
00:00:06,806 --> 00:00:08,858
Maya's pitcher is empty.

5
00:00:08,908 --> 00:00:10,240
Tipped over!

6
00:00:10,290 --> 00:00:11,611
Who did this?

7
00:00:11,661 --> 00:00:12,830
Oh no!

8
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:14,780
Here comes the trail book.

9
00:00:14,830 --> 00:00:16,741
It flips its pages.

10
00:00:16,791 --> 00:00:19,067
Every visit leaves a footprint.

11
00:00:19,117 --> 00:00:20,346
In order.

12
00:00:20,396 --> 00:00:22,408
First, Maya's shoe.

13
00:00:22,458 --> 00:00:24,450
Then three little dots.

14
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:25,872
The friends.

15
00:00:25,922 --> 00:00:27,355
They got a cup.

16
00:00:27,405 --> 00:00:28,625
All good.

17
00:00:28,675 --> 00:00:30,839
Then one big muddy print.

18
00:00:30,889 --> 00:00:32,129
The blob!

19
00:00:32,179 --> 00:00:33,348
At night.

20
00:00:33,398 --> 00:00:34,669
Splash!

21
00:00:34,719 --> 00:00:36,335
Now Maya knows.

22
00:00:36,385 --> 00:00:37,604
Who came.

23
00:00:37,654 --> 00:00:38,661
When.

24
00:00:38,711 --> 00:00:40,062
What they did.

25
00:00:40,112 --> 00:00:42,013
She refills the pitcher.

26
00:00:42,063 --> 00:00:43,394
Full again.

27
00:00:43,444 --> 00:00:45,324
The blob cannot hide.

28
00:00:45,374 --> 00:00:47,031
Nothing is hidden.

29
00:00:47,081 --> 00:00:48,087
Ever.

30
00:00:48,137 --> 00:00:50,383
The book remembers every step.

31
00:00:50,433 --> 00:00:52,221
That is the trail book.

32
00:00:52,271 --> 00:00:54,364
Now you know CloudTrail!

33
00:00:54,414 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
